Error [E0001]: `\q` isn't an escape Jet knows
  --> char_escape_unknown.jet:4:17
    |
  4 |     unknown :: '\q'
    |                 ^^
 Why: Inside a character literal, `\` starts an escape: `\n`, `\r`, `\t`, `\'`, `\\`
 Fix: Use a supported escape or a plain character
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0001
